WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
bukilib, toliqqan yuzlarimiz

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.000
ming chaqirimda tikilib turgan o'limga qarab turar

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Bor so'raganim faqat bir mo'jiza

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.000
men qayta tug'ilsamu

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.000
salga ishonmaydigan bo'lsam

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Hammaning aytgani shu

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.000
vaqt barin davolar derlar